      "summary": "Maria Rodriguez maintains Accessibility Audit Playbook, a released Design playbook for reviewing keyboard access, focus order, accessible names, and form feedback. Its Lead an Accessibility Review workflow begins with the user task and the relevant input data. The Trace Keyboard Focus activity records the order in which controls receive focus. Review Form Feedback checks that errors identify the field and explain recovery. Maria added Keyboard Navigation Audit to the public Accessible Forms Review playbook. She also revised Error Message Review to require a programmatic association between the field and its message. Two accepted Development additions cover accessible component fixtures and a focus regression checklist. Her examples distinguish an empty form, a partially completed form, and a rejected submission. This record describes published playbook contributions; availability and project fit still require a conversation.",
